  "design": {
    "identity": "Giant folded-wing kite raptor, hooked beak, grey-green feathers with one faded side, forest green wing coverts, nest twigs wrapped around talons, asymmetric shortened tail. Exactly two bird legs and two large feathered wings.",
    "attack": "Three distinct fast forward beak strikes with neck recoil, talons braced, strong shoulder follow-through; end in folded-wing stance.",
    "cast": "Deep crouch then huge fully spread wing upstroke, powerful aerial lift and long LEFT swooping dive with talons extended, wing brake and land back at origin.",
    "death": "Wings lose lift, body pitches down, lands on side, feathers settle; retain a coherent fallen bird."
  },
